# Your rule content

If there are more than 2 function arguments, you must use an object. 

Functions should be short and only do one thing. Separate functions into smaller units when necessary. 

Think about writing Functional Code. 

When creating utility functions, determine if one exists in the project you are working on. If not, add it to the utility directory and use it. 